WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.042 --> 00:00:01.543
Not again!

00:00:01.543 --> 00:00:02.377
Oh!

00:00:02.377 --> 00:00:04.421
[Osage]: 
He’s not that smart,

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:07.465
but he’s handsome.

00:00:07.465 --> 00:00:09.843
He looks like a snake.

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:14.305
No, he looks like a coyote.

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:16.975
Those blue eyes.

00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:22.689
His brother is handsome, too. 
I like the brother more.

00:00:24.315 --> 00:00:26.693
That red-haired rat?

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:33.450
Better than your possum
playing dead,

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:36.035
and lazing around the house.

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:37.287
[LAUGHTER]

00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:39.706
He’s a possum around you,

00:00:39.956 --> 00:00:42.250
he’s like a rabbit to me.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.127
[LAUGHTER]

00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:45.879
Be quiet,

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:47.839
Coyote’s watching.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.801
He wants our money.

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:54.637
Of course he wants money,

00:00:55.054 --> 00:00:57.599
but he wants to be settled.

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:02.479
He’s not restless.

00:01:02.479 --> 00:01:05.273
His uncle has money.

00:01:05.273 --> 00:01:07.442
It’s not money he wants,

00:01:07.984 --> 00:01:08.902
he loves you.

